    "The ultimate test of an investor is not how they behave during a roaring bull market when every asset is surging and optimism is everywhere; The True Test Is How You Respond When the Sky Is Falling and Markets Plunge into Severe Bear Market Drawdowns. Over your multi-decade compounding journey, you will inevitably live through multiple terrifying market panics: dot-com crashes, global financial crises, pandemics, and geopolitical shocks.",
