    "Furthermore, during bear market drawdowns, dividend reinvestment acts as a High-Speed Share Accumulator. When stock prices are down forty percent, your dividend payouts purchase forty percent more shares at the bottom, supercharging your recovery when the market rebounds.",
    "Turn on automatic dividend reinvestment across every holding in your portfolio today. Let corporate profits buy you more shares every ninety days, and watch your capital snowball compound into an unshakeable cash-flow fortress.",
    "In the next chapter, we expose The Traps of Wall Street: identifying the high-fee mutual funds, day trading delusions, and options gambling schemes that wipe out retail investors."
